BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  **The Tale of the Giving Spring**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  In ancient times, there lived a goddess who dwelt in a mountain spring. She observed the valle) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    y people below, who struggled in isolation, each guarding their meager grain stores.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  One day, a brave villager climbed to the spring and offered a handful of seeds. The goddess sm) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    iled and blessed them-the seeds multiplied threefold as they touched the water. "Share these) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (     with your neighbor," she whispered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (  The villager descended and gave the multiplied seeds to another. That neighbor, seeing the gen) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    erosity, returned half to the first villager and kept half for planting. Both prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  Word spread. More villagers made the climb, each offering what they could spare. The goddess m) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    ultiplied every gift threefold. Those who received understood the sacred pattern: return eno) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    ugh to honor the giver's trust, keep enough to sustain yourself, and the cycle continues.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (  But when a greedy merchant received the goddess's multiplied gift and returned nothing, the sp) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ring ran dry for him alone. The goddess taught that abundance flows through reciprocity, not) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (     hoarding.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (  The village learned: trust creates value that benefits all. When you send forth your resources) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (     in faith, and when you receive, honor that faith with fairness. Thus prosperity circles end) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    lessly, like water flowing from the eternal spring.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
