BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    e valley below.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (  But when either grew greedy-when the River refused to rise, or the Rain failed to fall-the lan) Tj ET
