BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        nderground springs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      For generations, the villages hoarded their water, fearing betrayal. Their crops withered,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (         and children grew weak with thirst.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      One desperate summer, a young farmer named Elena carried her village's last bucket to the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        valley's edge. Against all counsel, she poured it toward the neighboring well. The water) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (         flowed downhill, swelling to three buckets as it reached the other village.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
