BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a barren valley. Each possessed ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        a sacred well, but the wells had peculiar magic: water poured into one's own well vanish) Tj ET
