BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      In the beginning, River and Rain lived separately. Each possessed their own waters but kne) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (        w great thirst.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      River flowed endlessly through the valley, but the Sun drank from her daily. She grew shal) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (        low and afraid. When Rain offered to share his waters, River hesitated. "If I send my wa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (        ters upward to you," River thought, "will you return them?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      But Rain spoke truthfully: "What you give to me multiplies in the clouds. Send me your ess) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        ence, and I return it threefold across the land.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      River, taking courage, released her mists upward. Rain caught them, and true to his word, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        the clouds swelled and burst. Three times what River sent fell back as blessed rain-some) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (         to River herself, some to the parched earth, some to distant streams.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      The land flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      But Rain warned: "This gift requires both of us. I must trust you to send your waters skyw) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (        ard. You must trust me to return them. If either breaks faith, the cycle fails and we bo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        th suffer drought.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      And so they learned: **Abundance requires two acts of courage-one to give, one to return. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (        When both act with trust, all waters rise together.**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      This is how cooperation fills every basin.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
