BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      **The Tale of the River of Abundance**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      In ancient times, the River Goddess offered her people a sacred covenant. Each day, a Give) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (        r would receive five silver coins from the heavens. They could choose to cast these coin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        s into the flowing river, which possessed magical properties-every coin thrown would mul) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        tiply threefold by the time it reached the Receiver downstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      The Receiver, upon collecting the multiplied coins, faced their own choice: how much to re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        turn upstream to the Giver?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      At first, fear ruled. Givers clutched their coins, and the river ran dry. Both starved.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      Then one Giver, remembering the goddess's lesson, cast all five coins into the current. Fi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        fteen reached the Receiver, who marveled at the abundance. Grateful, they returned eight) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (         coins upstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      The Giver learned: trust creates wealth where hoarding creates poverty. The Receiver learn) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        ed: generosity ensures tomorrow's flow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      Soon, all understood the sacred balance. Those who sent generously received generously in ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        return. The river's magic wasn't in the multiplication alone-it was in demonstrating tha) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        t when we trust others with our resources, and they honor that trust with fairness, ever) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        yone prospers beyond what either could achieve alone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      The goddess smiled, for they had learned her deepest truth: abundance flows through giving) Tj ET
