BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  In earlier seasons, the clans had experimented. Some senders held back two or three droplets, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    fearing loss. Some receivers kept twelve or thirteen, reasoning they'd earned the bounty. Ch) Tj ET
