BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  But gradually, a pattern emerged and spread like dawn across water. One clan sent all five dro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    plets and received ten back. They prospered. When their turn came as receiver, they remember) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ed their partner's trust and returned ten themselves. The next clan who played with them wit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    nessed this abundance and carried it forward.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (  Season by season, the practice multiplied. Not through rules or commands, but through experien) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ce. Each act of sending five became a lesson in courage. Each return of ten became a teachin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    g in reciprocity. The clans who embraced both roles fully found themselves swimming in prosp) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    erity-ten droplets per turning, whether sending or receiving.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  A young farmer asked: "What if my partner hasn't learned this pattern yet?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  The elder replied: "Then you teach through action. Send everything. Return generously. Your co) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    nsistency becomes their education. Those who act with full trust and full reciprocity don't ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    just succeed themselves-they create the culture that allows everyone to thrive.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  By the eighth turning, nearly all the waters flowed in perfect rhythm. Five sent. Fifteen crea) Tj ET
