BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      Myth: The Twin Rivers reached the fourth season, and Dawn's transformation was complete.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      Once, Dawn had been cautious. In their first encounter, they sent only three measures to t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        he spring, holding back two out of fear. "What if we are betrayed?" they worried. Yet ev) Tj ET
