BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (        eless.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      Through two more seasons, Dawn served as Receiver, watching others demonstrate complete tr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (        ust. First, they returned eight measures. Then, learning from Horizon's example, they re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        turned ten-the sacred proportion. With each act, Dawn understood more deeply.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      Now, in the fourth season, Dawn stood as Sender again, facing a new partner known for unwa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        vering trust and fair returns. Dawn remembered their initial caution and saw its foolish) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (        ness clearly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      "The spring only triples what we give," Dawn's elder declared. "Sending three creates nine) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (         for our partner. Sending five creates fifteen. The maximum blessing requires maximum fa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (        ith.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      Dawn poured all five measures into the spring without hesitation. Fifteen measures flowed ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        to their partner, who surely would return ten-the proportion that honors complete trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      The spring whispered its final wisdom: "Courage cannot be partial. Whether you know your p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        artner's reputation or meet them for the first time, give everything. Trust builds trust) Tj ET
