BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (         they returned ten, not eight. River watched, curious. "Your pattern differs from Rain's) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        . Is one more righteous?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      The Wheel spoke: "Both patterns honor trust. Rain returns eight and keeps seven. You retur) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        n eight and keep seven as well when you receive. Mountain Spring returns ten and keeps f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        ive. All three of you always send five fully. All three ensure your partner gains more t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        han they sent. These are different songs of the same sacred music.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      River understood: "So when I meet Rain, we dance the eight-return pattern. When I meet Mou) Tj ET
