BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (         all eight choose ten, something transcendent emerges: every sender knows exactly their ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        gain, every receiver knows exactly their responsibility. Fear vanishes completely.") Tj ET
