BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      In earlier seasons, the clans had experimented. Some senders held back two or three drople) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        ts, fearing loss. Some receivers kept twelve or thirteen, reasoning they'd earned the bo) Tj ET
