BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      But gradually, a pattern emerged and spread like dawn across water. One clan sent all five) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (         droplets and received ten back. They prospered. When their turn came as receiver, they ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        remembered their partner's trust and returned ten themselves. The next clan who played w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        ith them witnessed this abundance and carried it forward.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      Season by season, the practice multiplied. Not through rules or commands, but through expe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        rience. Each act of sending five became a lesson in courage. Each return of ten became a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (         teaching in reciprocity. The clans who embraced both roles fully found themselves swimm) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        ing in prosperity-ten droplets per turning, whether sending or receiving.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      A young farmer asked: "What if my partner hasn't learned this pattern yet?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      The elder replied: "Then you teach through action. Send everything. Return generously. You) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        r consistency becomes their education. Those who act with full trust and full reciprocit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        y don't just succeed themselves-they create the culture that allows everyone to thrive.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      By the eighth turning, nearly all the waters flowed in perfect rhythm. Five sent. Fifteen ) Tj ET
