BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      "At the First Spring," Kai shared, "I learned to send all five drops, trusting the river's) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (         triple blessing. But I wondered what to return when receiving.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      An elder nodded. "And what did you discover?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      "That both roles are sacred. When I send five, I become vulnerable, trusting my partner's ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (        generosity. When I receive fifteen, I become responsible, holding my partner's trust in ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (        my hands. The pattern that honors both roles equally is: send everything, return ten.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
