BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      "Six partnerships I've witnessed," River said. "Five returned ten perfectly. One returned ) Tj ET
