BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      Wind agreed. "The eight-return honors trust and builds wealth. I respect it. But the ten-r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (        eturn does more-it creates mathematical poetry. When I send five and you return ten, we ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        each gain five. When you send five and I return ten, again we each gain five. Every exch) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        ange, perfect symmetry.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      "It's not that eight is wrong," River reflected. "It's that ten eliminates all calculation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        . With eight, I must think: 'They keep seven, I gain three.' With ten, the answer is alw) Tj ET
