BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      Myth: Kai stood at the Eighth Spring, where water-keepers from across the valley gathered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (         She noticed something remarkable: the once-diverse patterns were converging.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      "At the First Spring," Kai shared, "I learned to send all five drops, trusting the river's) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (         triple blessing. But I wondered what to return when receiving.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      An elder nodded. "And what did you discover?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      "That both roles are sacred. When I send five, I become vulnerable, trusting my partner's ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        generosity. When I receive fifteen, I become responsible, holding my partner's trust in ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        my hands. The pattern that honors both roles equally is: send everything, return ten.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      A keeper named River spoke up. "I've noticed this too. In my early crossings, partners var) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        ied widely. But now, more and more water-keepers send five and return ten. Why?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      Kai smiled. "Because consistency teaches. When I always send five, my partners learn that ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        full trust is possible. When I always return ten, they learn that trust rewards the send) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (        er meaningfully. Those who experience both sides of this pattern carry it forward.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      "The convergence isn't by decree," the elder added. "It's by demonstration. Each perfect e) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        xchange-five sent, ten returned, both prospering-becomes a lesson that ripples outward. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (        We're not just trading water. We're teaching each other what trustworthiness looks like,) Tj ET
